<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17197" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτρεπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unchangeable,</i> opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παθητός, οὐσία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chrysipp.Stoic.
					2.158
				</span></i>
			; <i>unmoved, inflexible,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				401b19
			</span></i>; <i>irreparable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.704
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μοῖρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					9(2).317
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				14.1839
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτρέπτους κἀπαραιτήτους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>D.</u>
					1.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. τὸ πρόσωπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>VH</u>
					2.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. πρὸς κινδύνους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					7.8.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸ κακῶς ἀκούειν</span>
			<i>indifferent</i> to ill-repute, <i>not caring,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				13
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.87
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				7.9.1
			</span></i>; <i>without hesitation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				34.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				17.17
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτρεμ-πτί</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				<u>Epim.</u>
				256
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Medic., of
			food, <i>undigested,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				16.800
			</span></i>.</div>
